WEBVTT

00:02.438 --> 00:03.647
Water...

00:04.816 --> 00:05.983
Earth...

00:06.693 --> 00:07.901
Fire...

00:08.987 --> 00:10.070
Air.

00:11.197 --> 00:14.449
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.368 --> 00:18.662
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.664 --> 00:20.789
Only the Avatar,

00:20.873 --> 00:22.332
master of all four elements,

00:22.417 --> 00:23.583
could stop them.

00:23.668 --> 00:25.419
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.503 --> 00:26.753
he vanished.

00:27.213 --> 00:28.380
A hundred years passed,

00:28.464 --> 00:30.882
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar,

00:30.967 --> 00:32.968
an airbender named Aang,

00:33.052 --> 00:35.095
and although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.179 --> 00:38.348
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.891 --> 00:41.935
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:03.875 --> 01:05.459
Wait till you see it, Katara.

01:05.543 --> 01:07.210
The air temple
is one of the most beautiful places

01:07.295 --> 01:08.420
in the world.

01:08.629 --> 01:10.297
Aang, I know you're excited,

01:10.381 --> 01:11.590
but it's been a hundred years

01:11.674 --> 01:13.008
since you've been home.

01:13.092 --> 01:14.551
That's why I'm so excited!

01:14.886 --> 01:17.471
It's just that a lot can change
in all that time.

01:17.555 --> 01:18.555
I know,

01:18.639 --> 01:20.057
but I need to see it for myself.

01:24.437 --> 01:25.896
Wake up, Sokka.

01:25.980 --> 01:27.689
Air temple, here we come!

01:29.359 --> 01:31.151
Sleep now. Temple later.

01:38.326 --> 01:39.659
Sokka, wake up!

01:39.744 --> 01:41.661
There's a prickle snake
in your sleeping bag!

01:42.455 --> 01:43.497
Aah!

01:43.581 --> 01:44.915
Get it off! Get it off!

01:44.999 --> 01:45.999
Aah!

01:46.125 --> 01:47.292
Heh heh heh!

01:47.377 --> 01:48.627
Great. You're awake.

01:48.711 --> 01:49.711
Let's go.

01:54.842 --> 01:56.176
Uncle, I want the repairs made

01:56.260 --> 01:57.302
as quickly as possible.

01:57.387 --> 01:58.720
I don't want to stay too long

01:58.805 --> 02:00.013
and risk losing his trail.

02:00.098 --> 02:01.306
You mean the Avatar?

02:01.391 --> 02:02.682
Don't mention his name on these docks.

02:03.017 --> 02:04.601
Once word gets out that he's alive,

02:04.685 --> 02:06.728
every firebender
will be out looking for him,

02:06.813 --> 02:08.647
and I don't want anyone
getting in the way.

02:08.731 --> 02:10.690
Getting in the way of what,

02:10.775 --> 02:11.942
Prince Zuko.

02:12.026 --> 02:13.485
Captain Zhao.

02:13.569 --> 02:14.903
It's commander now.

02:14.987 --> 02:16.363
And General Iroh,

02:16.447 --> 02:18.490
great hero of our nation.

02:18.574 --> 02:20.242
Retired general.

02:20.326 --> 02:21.952
The Fire Lord's brother and son

02:22.036 --> 02:23.912
are welcome guests anytime.

02:24.247 --> 02:25.705
What brings you to my harbor?

02:25.790 --> 02:27.582
Our ship is being repaired.

02:29.460 --> 02:31.169
That's quite a bit of damage.

02:31.546 --> 02:34.047
Yes. You wouldn't believe
what happened.

02:34.757 --> 02:36.842
Uncle, tell Commander Zhao
what happened.

02:36.926 --> 02:38.593
Yes, I will do that.

02:38.886 --> 02:40.929
It was incredible.

02:41.347 --> 02:42.931
What, did we crash or something?

02:43.015 --> 02:46.518
Yes! Right into an Earth Kingdom ship.

02:47.019 --> 02:48.019
Really?

02:48.104 --> 02:51.231
You must regale me
with all the thrilling details.

02:51.649 --> 02:53.608
Join me for a drink?

02:53.943 --> 02:55.318
Sorry, but we have to go.

02:55.403 --> 02:56.778
Prince Zuko,

02:56.863 --> 02:59.197
show Commander Zhao your respect.

02:59.615 --> 03:01.950
We would be honored to join you.

03:02.034 --> 03:05.537
Do you have any ginseng tea?
It's my favorite.

03:14.464 --> 03:16.047
Hey, stomach, be quiet, all right?

03:16.132 --> 03:17.883
I'm trying to find us some food.

03:24.724 --> 03:27.350
Hey! Who ate all
my blubbered seal jerky?

03:27.435 --> 03:29.519
That was food?

03:29.604 --> 03:31.688
I used it to start
the campfire last night.

03:31.772 --> 03:32.898
Sorry.

03:32.982 --> 03:34.524
You what?

03:34.609 --> 03:35.817
Aww.

03:35.902 --> 03:37.944
No wonder the flames smelled so good.

03:40.656 --> 03:41.781
The Potola mountain range!

03:41.866 --> 03:43.366
We're almost there!

03:43.451 --> 03:45.368
Aang, before we get to the temple,

03:45.453 --> 03:47.579
I want to talk to you
about the airbenders.

03:47.663 --> 03:48.788
What about them?

03:48.873 --> 03:49.956
Well...

03:50.041 --> 03:51.416
I just want you to be prepared

03:51.501 --> 03:52.959
for what you might see.

03:53.294 --> 03:55.295
The Fire Nation is ruthless.

03:55.379 --> 03:57.380
They killed my mother,

03:57.465 --> 03:58.590
and they could have done the same

03:58.674 --> 04:00.091
to your people.

04:00.426 --> 04:02.344
Just because no one
has seen an airbender

04:02.428 --> 04:04.137
doesn't mean the Fire Nation
killed them all.

04:04.222 --> 04:05.555
They probably escaped.

04:05.640 --> 04:07.432
I know it's hard to accept.

04:07.517 --> 04:09.142
You don't understand, Katara.

04:09.227 --> 04:10.602
The only way to get to
an airbender temple

04:10.686 --> 04:12.187
is on a flying bison,

04:12.271 --> 04:14.356
and I doubt the Fire Nation
has any flying bison.

04:14.440 --> 04:15.565
Right, Appa?

04:16.901 --> 04:18.068
Yip yip!

04:33.209 --> 04:36.878
There it is,
the Southern Air Temple.

04:37.713 --> 04:39.339
Aang, it's amazing!

04:40.216 --> 04:42.384
We're home, buddy. We're home.

04:47.473 --> 04:48.640
And by year's end,

04:48.724 --> 04:50.850
the Earth Kingdom capital
will be under our rule.

04:51.686 --> 04:53.979
The Fire Lord will finally claim

04:54.063 --> 04:55.272
victory in this war.

04:55.356 --> 04:57.023
If my father thinks
the rest of the world

04:57.108 --> 04:58.275
will follow him willingly,

04:58.359 --> 04:59.568
then he is a fool.

05:00.027 --> 05:01.027
Two years at sea

05:01.112 --> 05:02.779
have done little
to temper your tongue.

05:03.739 --> 05:07.242
So, how's your search
for the Avatar going?

05:09.704 --> 05:12.205
My fault entirely.

05:12.999 --> 05:14.624
We haven't found him yet.

05:14.709 --> 05:16.543
Did you really expect to?

05:16.627 --> 05:18.878
The Avatar died a hundred years ago

05:18.963 --> 05:21.506
along with the rest of the airbenders.

05:22.633 --> 05:24.843
Unless you found some evidence

05:24.927 --> 05:26.553
that the Avatar is alive.

05:26.637 --> 05:28.638
No. Nothing.

05:29.056 --> 05:31.641
Prince Zuko,
the Avatar is the only one

05:31.726 --> 05:32.892
who can stop the Fire Nation

05:32.977 --> 05:34.477
from winning this war.

05:34.562 --> 05:36.605
If you have an ounce of loyalty left,

05:36.689 --> 05:38.648
you'll tell me what you found.

05:38.733 --> 05:41.109
I haven't found anything.

05:41.861 --> 05:43.028
It's like you said--

05:43.112 --> 05:46.281
The Avatar probably died
a long time ago.

05:46.866 --> 05:48.742
Come on, uncle. We're going.

05:49.327 --> 05:50.952
Commander Zhao,

05:51.037 --> 05:53.038
we interrogated the crew
as you instructed.

05:53.122 --> 05:54.497
They confirmed Prince Zuko

05:54.582 --> 05:56.374
had the Avatar in custody

05:56.459 --> 05:58.001
but let him escape.

05:58.794 --> 06:00.712
Now remind me,

06:00.796 --> 06:05.008
how exactly was your ship damaged?

06:12.933 --> 06:14.517
So where do I get something to eat?

06:14.977 --> 06:17.812
You're lucky enough
to be one of the first outsiders

06:17.897 --> 06:19.981
to ever visit an airbender temple,

06:20.066 --> 06:22.025
and all you can think about is food?

06:22.318 --> 06:24.861
I'm just a simple guy
with simple needs.

06:26.072 --> 06:27.238
So that's where my friends and I

06:27.323 --> 06:28.448
would play airball,

06:28.532 --> 06:30.617
and over there is where
the bison would sleep.

06:30.701 --> 06:31.701
And...

06:32.995 --> 06:34.245
What's wrong?

06:34.330 --> 06:37.165
This place used to be full of monks
and lemurs and bison.

06:37.500 --> 06:39.042
Now there's just a bunch of weeds.

06:41.629 --> 06:44.422
I can't believe how much
things have changed.

06:45.383 --> 06:46.383
So,

06:46.467 --> 06:48.134
this airball game-- How do you play?

07:02.274 --> 07:03.358
Ooh!

07:04.485 --> 07:05.777
Ha ha ha!

07:06.445 --> 07:08.780
Aang seven, Sokka zero.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.615
Making him feel better

07:10.700 --> 07:12.158
is putting me in a world of hurt.

07:17.248 --> 07:19.290
Katara, check this out.

07:20.543 --> 07:21.626
Fire Nation.

07:21.711 --> 07:22.961
We should tell him.

07:23.546 --> 07:25.714
Aang, there's something
you need to see.

07:26.340 --> 07:27.424
Ok.

07:33.681 --> 07:34.806
What is it?

07:34.890 --> 07:38.101
Just a new
waterbending move I learned.

07:38.185 --> 07:40.061
Nice one. But enough practicing.

07:40.521 --> 07:42.397
We have a whole temple to see.

07:44.024 --> 07:46.025
You know,
you can't protect him forever.

07:53.075 --> 07:54.826
Katara, firebenders were here.

07:54.910 --> 07:56.286
You can't pretend they weren't.

07:56.620 --> 07:58.371
I can for Aang's sake.

07:58.456 --> 08:01.332
If he finds out that the Fire Nation
invaded his home,

08:01.417 --> 08:02.625
he'll be devastated.

08:02.710 --> 08:03.960
Hey, guys!

08:04.378 --> 08:05.670
I want you to meet somebody.

08:05.755 --> 08:06.796
Who's that?

08:06.881 --> 08:08.298
Monk Gyatso,

08:08.382 --> 08:09.924
the greatest airbender in the world.

08:10.718 --> 08:12.761
He taught me everything I know.

08:16.015 --> 08:20.018
But the true secret
is in the gooey center.

08:21.687 --> 08:23.813
My ancient cake making technique

08:23.898 --> 08:25.940
isn't the only thing on your mind,

08:26.025 --> 08:27.692
is it, Aang?

08:27.777 --> 08:29.611
This whole Avatar thing--

08:29.695 --> 08:31.905
Maybe the monks made a mistake.

08:32.239 --> 08:33.865
The only mistake they made

08:33.949 --> 08:36.659
was telling you before you turned 16.

08:36.744 --> 08:39.537
But we can't concern ourselves
with what was.

08:39.622 --> 08:42.040
We must act on what is.

08:46.629 --> 08:47.921
But, Gyatso,

08:48.005 --> 08:49.839
how do I know if I'm ready for this?

08:50.299 --> 08:52.258
Your questions will be answered

08:52.343 --> 08:56.387
when you're old enough
to enter the air temple sanctuary.

08:56.722 --> 08:58.973
Inside, you will meet someone

08:59.058 --> 09:01.309
who will guide you on your journey.

09:01.393 --> 09:02.560
Who is it?

09:02.645 --> 09:04.187
When you are ready,

09:04.271 --> 09:06.356
he will reveal himself to you.

09:07.525 --> 09:08.691
Now...

09:09.318 --> 09:12.153
Are you going to help me
with these cakes

09:12.238 --> 09:13.363
or not?

09:13.447 --> 09:14.739
All right.

09:16.200 --> 09:18.535
One... Two...

09:18.619 --> 09:19.619
Three.

09:29.547 --> 09:31.506
Your aim has improved greatly,

09:31.590 --> 09:33.550
my young pupil.

09:37.805 --> 09:39.430
You must miss him.

09:39.515 --> 09:40.723
Yeah.

09:40.808 --> 09:42.141
Where are you going?

09:42.226 --> 09:43.768
The air temple sanctuary.

09:43.853 --> 09:45.353
There's someone I'm ready to meet.

09:53.279 --> 09:54.487
But, Aang,

09:54.572 --> 09:55.905
no one could have survived in there

09:55.990 --> 09:57.615
for a hundred years.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.242
It's not impossible.

09:59.326 --> 10:01.286
I survived in the iceberg
for that long.

10:01.370 --> 10:02.370
Good point.

10:02.663 --> 10:04.414
Katara, whoever's in there

10:04.498 --> 10:06.291
might help me figure out
this Avatar thing.

10:06.375 --> 10:08.459
And whoever's in there
might have a medley

10:08.544 --> 10:11.421
of delicious cured meats.

10:12.381 --> 10:13.590
Ooh!

10:13.674 --> 10:14.674
Unh!

10:16.051 --> 10:17.886
I don't suppose you have a key.

10:17.970 --> 10:20.763
The key, Sokka, is airbending.

10:49.627 --> 10:51.002
Hello?

10:51.420 --> 10:52.837
Anyone home?

11:05.225 --> 11:06.601
So a 12-year-old boy

11:06.685 --> 11:08.853
bested you and your firebenders.

11:09.563 --> 11:11.397
You're more pathetic than I thought.

11:11.482 --> 11:12.899
I underestimated him once,

11:12.983 --> 11:14.317
but it will not happen again.

11:14.401 --> 11:15.777
No, it will not,

11:15.861 --> 11:17.612
because you won't
have a second chance.

11:17.696 --> 11:18.696
Commander Zhao,

11:18.781 --> 11:20.740
I've been hunting the Avatar
for two years, and I--

11:20.824 --> 11:21.950
And you failed.

11:22.034 --> 11:23.576
Capturing the Avatar is too important

11:23.661 --> 11:25.536
to leave in a teenager's hands.

11:25.621 --> 11:26.996
He's mine now.

11:28.624 --> 11:29.791
Keep them here.

11:33.629 --> 11:35.505
More tea, please.

11:50.980 --> 11:52.563
Statues?

11:52.648 --> 11:53.982
That's it?

11:54.066 --> 11:55.566
Where's the meat?

11:55.901 --> 11:57.235
Who are all these people?

11:57.319 --> 11:59.278
I'm not sure.

11:59.363 --> 12:01.239
But it feels like I know them somehow.

12:01.323 --> 12:02.323
Look!

12:02.408 --> 12:03.533
That one's an airbender!

12:03.617 --> 12:05.034
And this one's a waterbender.

12:05.369 --> 12:06.619
They're lined up in a pattern.

12:07.246 --> 12:10.373
Air, water, earth, and fire.

12:10.457 --> 12:12.083
That's the Avatar cycle.

12:12.167 --> 12:14.752
Of course. They're Avatars.

12:15.212 --> 12:17.588
All these people
are your past lives, Aang.

12:17.673 --> 12:20.383
Wow! There's so many.

12:23.137 --> 12:24.429
Past lives?

12:24.513 --> 12:26.681
Katara, you really
believe in that stuff?

12:26.765 --> 12:27.974
It's true.

12:28.058 --> 12:30.018
When the Avatar dies,

12:30.102 --> 12:32.020
he's reincarnated
into the next nation in the cycle.

12:38.652 --> 12:40.319
Aang, snap out of it.

12:42.781 --> 12:44.073
Who is that?

12:44.158 --> 12:46.659
That's Avatar Roku,
the Avatar before me.

12:47.369 --> 12:48.953
You were a firebender?

12:49.038 --> 12:51.080
No wonder I didn't trust you
when we first met.

12:51.290 --> 12:52.582
There's no writing.

12:52.666 --> 12:53.666
How do you know his name?

12:53.751 --> 12:55.001
I'm not sure.

12:55.419 --> 12:57.378
I just know it somehow.

12:58.672 --> 13:00.298
You just couldn't get any weirder.

13:00.591 --> 13:02.341
♪♪♪♪

13:10.059 --> 13:12.268
Firebender.
Nobody make a sound.

13:12.394 --> 13:13.478
You're making a sound.

13:13.562 --> 13:14.604
Shh! Shh!

13:22.029 --> 13:23.905
That firebender
won't know what hit him.

13:34.583 --> 13:35.583
Lemur!

13:35.667 --> 13:36.793
Dinner.

13:36.877 --> 13:38.211
Don't listen to him.

13:38.295 --> 13:39.587
You're gonna be my new pet.

13:39.671 --> 13:40.880
Not if I get him first!

13:45.135 --> 13:46.302
Wait! Come back!

13:46.386 --> 13:48.221
I want to eat you!

13:55.020 --> 13:56.312
Ha ha ha!

13:58.649 --> 13:59.982
Aah! Unh!

14:11.411 --> 14:12.662
Hey! No fair!

14:18.085 --> 14:19.210
My search party is ready.

14:19.294 --> 14:21.003
Once I'm out to sea,

14:21.088 --> 14:22.797
my guards will escort you
back to your ship,

14:22.881 --> 14:24.423
And you will be free to go.

14:24.508 --> 14:26.050
Why? Are you worried

14:26.135 --> 14:28.010
I'm going to try and stop you?

14:28.345 --> 14:30.346
Ha ha ha!

14:30.430 --> 14:32.473
You... Stop me?

14:32.558 --> 14:33.766
Impossible.

14:34.059 --> 14:35.810
Don't underestimate me, Zhao.

14:35.894 --> 14:37.728
I will capture the Avatar before you.

14:38.063 --> 14:39.897
Prince Zuko, that's enough.

14:39.982 --> 14:42.233
You can't compete with me.

14:42.317 --> 14:44.777
I have hundreds of warships
under my command,

14:44.862 --> 14:45.987
And you,

14:46.071 --> 14:47.822
you're just a banished prince.

14:47.906 --> 14:50.616
No home, no allies.

14:50.701 --> 14:52.910
Your own father doesn't even want you.

14:53.245 --> 14:54.495
You're wrong.

14:54.580 --> 14:56.372
Once I deliver
the Avatar to my father,

14:56.456 --> 14:58.457
he will welcome me home with honor

14:58.542 --> 15:00.751
and restore my rightful place
on the throne.

15:01.086 --> 15:03.796
If your father really wanted you home,

15:03.881 --> 15:05.464
he would have let you return by now,

15:05.549 --> 15:07.758
Avatar or no Avatar.

15:07.843 --> 15:09.844
But in his eyes, you are a failure

15:09.928 --> 15:11.846
and a disgrace to the Fire Nation.

15:11.930 --> 15:13.181
That's not true.

15:13.682 --> 15:15.391
You have the scar to prove it.

15:15.475 --> 15:17.602
Aah! Maybe you'd like one to match!

15:17.686 --> 15:19.312
Is that a challenge?

15:19.396 --> 15:22.231
An Agni Kai at sunset.

15:22.983 --> 15:24.066
Very well.

15:24.693 --> 15:26.611
It's a shame your father won't be here

15:26.695 --> 15:28.738
to watch me humiliate you.

15:28.822 --> 15:30.531
I guess your uncle will do.

15:31.074 --> 15:32.575
Prince Zuko,

15:32.659 --> 15:34.076
have you forgotten what happened

15:34.161 --> 15:35.995
the last time you dueled a master?

15:36.538 --> 15:38.080
I will never forget.

15:44.963 --> 15:46.422
Hey! Come back!

15:47.007 --> 15:48.466
Come on out, little lemur.

15:48.550 --> 15:50.593
That hungry guy
won't bother you anymore.

15:54.723 --> 15:56.307
Firebenders?

15:56.391 --> 15:58.267
They were here?

16:05.317 --> 16:06.817
Gyatso.

16:08.362 --> 16:09.946
Hey, Aang, you find my dinner yet?

16:11.156 --> 16:14.200
Aang, I wasn't really gonna
eat the lemur, ok?

16:14.868 --> 16:16.077
Man.

16:17.037 --> 16:18.120
Come on, Aang.

16:18.205 --> 16:19.455
Everything will be all right.

16:19.539 --> 16:20.665
Let's get out of here.

16:37.266 --> 16:38.266
Aang!

16:49.653 --> 16:52.571
Send word
to the Fire Lord immediately.

16:52.656 --> 16:54.865
The Avatar has returned.

17:01.832 --> 17:03.457
Aang, come on!

17:03.542 --> 17:05.418
Snap out of it! Aah!

17:08.046 --> 17:09.255
Aah! Unh!

17:15.595 --> 17:16.679
What happened?

17:17.139 --> 17:19.140
He found out firebenders
killed Gyatso.

17:19.224 --> 17:21.642
No. It's his Avatar spirit.

17:21.935 --> 17:23.185
He must have triggered it.

17:23.270 --> 17:25.271
I'm gonna try and calm him down.

17:25.355 --> 17:26.731
Well, do it,

17:26.815 --> 17:28.649
before he blows us off the mountain!

17:43.749 --> 17:47.960
Remember your firebending basics,
Prince Zuko.

17:48.170 --> 17:49.795
They are your greatest weapons.

17:50.005 --> 17:51.255
I refuse to let him win.

17:53.216 --> 17:55.551
This will be over quickly.

18:34.925 --> 18:36.133
Basics, Zuko.

18:36.426 --> 18:37.635
Break his root.

18:38.387 --> 18:46.185
Unh!

18:55.904 --> 18:57.363
Aah!

19:15.882 --> 19:16.882
Unh!

19:24.641 --> 19:25.641
Do it!

19:30.147 --> 19:31.230
That's it?

19:31.857 --> 19:33.524
Your father raised a coward.

19:33.608 --> 19:36.026
Next time you get in my way,
I promise,

19:36.111 --> 19:37.820
I won't hold back.

19:48.373 --> 19:49.707
Unh!

19:50.834 --> 19:52.293
No, Prince Zuko.

19:52.377 --> 19:55.045
Do not taint your victory.

19:55.422 --> 19:57.798
So this is how
the great Commander Zhao

19:57.883 --> 19:59.133
acts in defeat?

20:00.135 --> 20:01.260
Disgraceful.

20:01.970 --> 20:03.429
Even in exile,

20:03.513 --> 20:07.099
my nephew is more honorable than you.

20:07.601 --> 20:09.685
Thanks again for the tea.

20:09.769 --> 20:11.437
It was delicious.

20:16.735 --> 20:18.194
Did you really mean that, uncle?

20:18.278 --> 20:19.778
Of course.

20:19.863 --> 20:22.531
I told you ginseng tea is my favorite.

20:27.454 --> 20:30.289
Aang, I know you're upset,

20:30.373 --> 20:31.916
and I know how hard it is

20:32.000 --> 20:33.834
to lose the people you love.

20:34.461 --> 20:37.505
I went through the same thing
when I lost my mom.

20:38.215 --> 20:40.424
Monk Gyatso and the other airbenders

20:40.509 --> 20:42.218
may be gone,

20:42.761 --> 20:45.095
but you still have a family.

20:45.180 --> 20:47.806
Sokka and I, we're your family now.

20:57.776 --> 20:58.776
Katara and I

20:58.860 --> 21:00.319
aren't gonna let anything
happen to you.

21:00.403 --> 21:01.529
Promise.

21:06.576 --> 21:07.701
I'm sorry.

21:07.786 --> 21:08.911
It's ok.

21:08.995 --> 21:10.287
It wasn't your fault.

21:10.372 --> 21:11.664
But you were right.

21:11.748 --> 21:13.457
And if firebenders found this temple,

21:13.792 --> 21:15.584
That means
they found the other ones, too.

21:16.378 --> 21:18.087
I really am the last airbender.

21:26.638 --> 21:27.930
Everything's packed.

21:28.014 --> 21:29.348
You ready to go?

21:29.432 --> 21:30.933
How is Roku supposed to help me

21:31.017 --> 21:32.309
if I can't talk to him?

21:32.394 --> 21:34.019
Maybe you'll find a way.

21:34.980 --> 21:36.397
♪♪♪♪

21:44.864 --> 21:46.532
Looks like you made
a new friend, Sokka.

21:47.867 --> 21:49.785
Can't talk. Must eat.

21:50.495 --> 21:51.870
Hey, little guy.

21:55.000 --> 21:57.376
You, me, and Appa--

21:57.586 --> 21:59.503
We're all that's left of this place.

21:59.588 --> 22:01.380
We have to stick together.

22:01.464 --> 22:03.257
Katara, Sokka,

22:03.800 --> 22:06.552
say hello to the newest
member of our family.

22:06.636 --> 22:07.761
What are you gonna name him?

22:10.557 --> 22:12.099
Momo.
